# Title: Suspicious Uninstall of Windows Defender Feature via PowerShell
# ID: c443012c-7928-43bf-ac20-7eda5efe61ad
# Status: experimental
# Level: high
# Author: yxinmiracle
# Date: 2025-08-22
# Tags: attack.defense-impairment, attack.t1685
# Description: Detects the use of PowerShell with Uninstall-WindowsFeature or Remove-WindowsFeature cmdlets to disable or remove the Windows Defender GUI feature, a common technique used by adversaries to evade defenses.
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

((cmdline:*Windows-Defender*) AND ((cmdline:*Uninstall-WindowsFeature* OR cmdline:*Remove-WindowsFeature*)) AND (((process_name:*\\powershell_ise.exe OR process_name:*\\powershell.exe OR process_name:*\\pwsh.exe)) OR ((OriginalFileName:"PowerShell_ISE.EXE" OR OriginalFileName:"PowerShell.EXE" OR OriginalFileName:"pwsh.dll"))))
